N 1 1 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 99 5
N 2 2 2 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 3
N 3 3 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 4
N 4 4 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 105 2
N 5 5 2 S LMT GTC 0 CN 104 1
# Account 1's switch with CANCEL: its orders go in book order, bids best first, then asks.
K 6 1 ON CANCEL
N 7 6 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 98 1
N 8 7 2 B LMT GTC 0 CN 98 1
# The global switch blocks every account; cancels still work.
K 9 * ON KEEP
N 10 8 2 S LMT GTC 0 CN 110 1
C 11 7
# Releasing the global switch leaves account 1's on.
K 12 * OFF KEEP
N 13 9 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 110 1
K 14 1 OFF KEEP
N 15 10 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 110 1
# CANCEL without ON is refused.
K 16 2 OFF CANCEL
